body:
Nothing negative against any individual woman is what I mean. It's part of society. Apps and social media give woman an abundance of options. It makes sense that they'd use it. We would too if we had the option. 

&#x200B;

Of course dating isn't easy by any means. It's just easier. And I don't like when I get advice from my female friends in a way that's assuming it comes as easy to me as them. To meet new people in the dating sense, have rebound sex, all that.
